    "overview": "NoteMD is minimalist, functional, and simple. White working areas, quiet gray navigation, and one blue action accent let patient records and clinical writing carry the interface. This language records the implemented clinician application and the user's confirmed direction.\n\nCompact rows and fine dividers provide structure without decorative dashboard cards or charts. Segoe UI keeps the workspace familiar. Patient context accompanies the note editor, with a compact context strip replacing the desktop side panel on smaller screens.",
